NCS601W is a wireless IP camera with 640 x 480 CMOS sensor and IR LEDs for night view.

  * Informative website: [[http://www.wanda25.de/wansview_ncs601w.html]]

Possible clones:

  * //Belkin Netcam F7D7601v1// works with the OpenWrt image for the NCS601w ((http://www.wanda25.de/wansview_ncs601w.html))
  * FCCid [[https://fcc.io/A5JC10150|A5JC10150]] leads to pictures showing //imogenstudio +CAM//

