==== Installation method: U-Boot TFTP + serial ====

  - boot initramfs (option 1 in U-Boot)
  - flash sysupgrade via mtd (not possible via CLI or LuCI((http://www.wanda25.de/wansview_ncs601w.html))):\\ <code>mtd write /tmp/openwrt-ramips-rt305x-ncs601W-squashfs-sysupgrade.bin firmware</code>

:!: Please mind that after installation of OpenWrt there are no video specific packages pre-installed, i.e. you have to install them manually. Alternatively you can compile your own image with all necessary packages already included.


